{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de9b5a8670edb06e1aa18cc1151d9590fb0259a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2 - x)(2 - x - 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/040b6862068661ef7a17dd3d651cb57b4f7ab9d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   -12  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   4 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   0 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   12 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   -4 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"447\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into the expression, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83e76b0c11d290a7abd809f82934829c446c303d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + 2 - 2)(2 - 2 - 2) = 2 \\times -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd683f44fdcf423657b6ff6e0d3835d0b3eaa940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } -4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b668601cc8a6ec32c9885fd1204365ec25525202.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 2 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/c/28c617834a14ebfce80cc5a5c0d2de176da158b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 - x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/9/52969fdeeb90f7e24cd2a2f1a6cfe124776fee2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, so the expression simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/7/3d7d8b249a91fc520365afa0801a31a89091f238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2x$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd8c745a9644880f68039d0ca756067c0ba7fff4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2 \\times 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } -4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"157\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/w